{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"text","name":"Title","settings":{"text":"<h1>Our Vision<\/h1>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h1","font":"var(--font-primary--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_fBRGPN":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":100,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}},"text_8bqbWi":{"type":"text","name":"HotWax store story","settings":{"text":"<h3>A small store with a bigger purpose<\/h3>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_9EKk7E":{"type":"text","name":"HotWax story description","settings":{"text":"<p>We launched this eCommerce experience to show what modern retail can feel like when the right systems are working behind the scenes.<\/p><p>As you browse this store and choose your gift, you’re also experiencing HotWax Commerce in action. Every product page, delivery promise, and fulfillment option demonstrates how retailers manage inventory across stores, route orders intelligently, and fulfill from the best location. <\/p><p>Instead of explaining omnichannel commerce in slides or presentations, we wanted to show it the way customers experience it, through a real shopping journey.<\/p><p>This store is our way of bringing that experience to life.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_4xqfKf":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":100,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}},"text_LbNa9Y":{"type":"text","name":"Gifts story","settings":{"text":"<h3>Celebrating craftsmanship across India<\/h3>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_VgLjJ4":{"type":"text","name":"Gifts story description","settings":{"text":"<p>The products you see here come from artisans across India.<\/p><p>Every region has its own craft traditions, techniques refined over generations. In some places it’s hand-woven textiles. In others, wood carving, pottery, metalwork, or block printing.<\/p><p>These crafts are deeply tied to the culture of the communities that create them.<\/p><p>They carry stories of materials, tools, and skills passed down through generations over decades. While the world around them changes, many of these artisans continue their work the same way it has always been done: patiently, carefully, by hand.<\/p><p>By choosing one of these gifts, you’re supporting the artisans who keep these traditions alive and helping their work reach people far beyond their local communities.<\/p><p>Every item in this store carries a small piece of that heritage.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_CDyPhe":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":100,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}},"text_XAzmPz":{"type":"text","name":"Plantation story","settings":{"text":"<h3>Thinking about the footprint of retail<\/h3>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_9WXxmd":{"type":"text","name":"Plantation story description","settings":{"text":"<p>Retail moves an incredible number of products around the world every day. New inventory arrives in warehouses, products move between stores and orders are delivered to customers. Every step in that journey carries an environmental cost.<\/p><p>At HotWax Commerce, we believe businesses should think about the impact they leave behind.<\/p><p>So for every meeting that comes from this experience, <strong>we commit to planting 100 trees.<\/strong><\/p><p>It’s a simple idea. A conversation about commerce can also contribute to restoring something back to the planet.<\/p><p>Over time, we hope these small actions grow into forests.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_tnjwjE":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":100,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}},"divider_kLLBH7":{"type":"_divider","name":"t:names.divider","settings":{"thickness":1,"corner_radius":"square","width_percent":100,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_YGNTkp":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":100,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}},"text_xBmAzY":{"type":"text","name":"Purpose","settings":{"text":"<h3>Technology with purpose<\/h3><p><\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_AbFeae":{"type":"text","name":"Purpose description","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax Commerce exists to help retailers operate smarter, to manage inventory better, fulfill orders faster and deliver great customer experiences.<\/p><p>We believe technology should always serve something larger than efficiency.<\/p><p>Sangam brings together three things we care about deeply: thoughtful technology, meaningful craftsmanship and responsibility toward the planet.<\/p><p>Thank you for taking part in this experience.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["heading","spacer_fBRGPN","text_8bqbWi","text_9EKk7E","spacer_4xqfKf","text_LbNa9Y","text_VgLjJ4","spacer_CDyPhe","text_XAzmPz","text_9WXxmd","spacer_tnjwjE","divider_kLLBH7","spacer_YGNTkp","text_xBmAzY","text_AbFeae"],"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":32,"color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding-block-start":80,"padding-block-end":80}}},"order":["main"]}